VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'ever. And we\'ll compare it to the new clip-on flashlight from Milwaukee. Whether it\'s electrical, HVAC, plumbing, auto repair, or farming—you need a flashlight with multiple mounting options. The link will be in the video description below so you can'

